以下代码输出"小狗汪汪叫 小猫喵喵叫"（各输出末尾带一个空格），这体现了面向对象编程的（ ）特性。

```cpp
class Animal {
public:
    virtual void speak() { cout << "动物叫 "; }
};
class Dog : public Animal {
public:
    void speak() override { cout << "小狗汪汪叫 "; }
};
class Cat : public Animal {
public:
    void speak() override { cout << "小猫喵喵叫 "; }
};
int main() {
    Animal* a1 = new Dog();
    Animal* a2 = new Cat();
    a1->speak();
    a2->speak();
    return 0;
}
```

